      <div style="opacity: 0.8; line-height: 1.8;">
        <p><strong>Last Updated: June 2026</strong></p>
        <h2 style="margin-top: 40px; margin-bottom: 10px;">1. What data we collect</h2>
        <p>When you place an order or contact us, we collect the following personal information: Name, email address, social media handles (e.g., Instagram/Twitter), uploaded files/references, and payment details (via PayPal).</p>

        <h2 style="margin-top: 40px; margin-bottom: 10px;">2. Why we collect it</h2>
        <p>This data is strictly used to fulfill your design orders, communicate regarding project revisions, and process secure payments.</p>

        <h2 style="margin-top: 40px; margin-bottom: 10px;">3. Third Parties</h2>
        <p>We use trusted third-party services to operate this business. Your data may be processed by: <strong>Tally</strong> (for order forms), <strong>PayPal</strong> (for payments), <strong>GitHub Pages</strong> (for website hosting), and our analytics providers.</p>

        <h2 style="margin-top: 40px; margin-bottom: 10px;">4. Data Retention</h2>
        <p>Your data is kept only as long as necessary to fulfill your order and maintain required business and tax records.</p>

        <h2 style="margin-top: 40px; margin-bottom: 10px;">5. Your GDPR Rights</h2>
        <p>If you are located in the EU, you have the right to access, correct, or request the deletion of your personal data. Please contact us at <a href="mailto:designs.of.desirex@gmail.com" class="gold-gradient-text">designs.of.desirex@gmail.com</a> to exercise these rights.</p>

        <h2 style="margin-top: 40px; margin-bottom: 10px;">6. Moroccan Law 09-08</h2>
        <p>This business is operated from Morocco. We process your data in compliance with Moroccan Law 09-08 on the protection of individuals with regard to the processing of personal data.</p>
