      <h1 style="font-size: 3rem; margin-bottom: 20px;" data-i18n="nav_terms">Terms of Service</h1>
      <div style="opacity: 0.8; line-height: 1.8;">
        <p><strong>Last Updated: June 2026</strong></p>
        
        <h2 style="margin-top: 40px; margin-bottom: 10px;">1. Scope & Revisions</h2>
        <p>All design work includes a set number of revisions as outlined in the project agreement. Additional revisions outside the original scope may incur extra fees. Once final files are delivered, any further changes require a new project quote.</p>

        <h2 style="margin-top: 40px; margin-bottom: 10px;">2. Payment & Refunds</h2>
        <p>Payments are processed via PayPal. Because all digital work is custom and personalized, <strong>all sales are final and non-refundable once work has begun.</strong> By placing an order, EU consumers explicitly waive their 14-day right of withdrawal for digital content and custom services.</p>

        <h2 style="margin-top: 40px; margin-bottom: 10px;">3. Intellectual Property & Usage</h2>
        <p>Upon final payment, the client receives full commercial usage rights for the final design for their own brand and business. However, you may not resell, redistribute, or license the editable files or designs as generic templates to third parties.</p>

        <h2 style="margin-top: 40px; margin-bottom: 10px;">4. Client Portfolio Consent</h2>
        <p>We love showcasing our clients. We will only feature your specific name, brand, or project visuals in our public portfolio or social media after receiving your explicit written consent.</p>

        <h2 style="margin-top: 40px; margin-bottom: 10px;">5. Age & Content Representation</h2>
        <p>By ordering, you confirm that you are at least 18 years of age. If providing reference material, you confirm that any individuals depicted are 18+ and have consented to the material being shared. We reserve the right to immediately refuse or cancel any order involving illegal, non-consensual, or exploitative content.</p>

        <h2 style="margin-top: 40px; margin-bottom: 10px;">6. Trademark Disclaimer</h2>
        <p>Designs of Desire is an independent design studio. We are not affiliated with, endorsed by, or officially connected to OnlyFans, Fansly, Patreon, Instagram, or PayPal. Any platform names mentioned are for descriptive purposes only.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

