          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What website packages are available?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Designs of desire offers four creator website tiers: Starter: Link & Look for EUR 150 to EUR 250, Growth: Creator Presence for EUR 400 to EUR 700, Pro: Monetization Hub for EUR 1,000 to EUR 1,600, and Business: Creator Business starting at EUR 2,000 after a discovery call."
          }
