  <main>
  <header class="page-header container reveal">
    <h1>Your Own Platform.<br>Your Own Rules.</h1>
    <p>Get a high-end look without paying agency prices.</p>
  </header>

  <section class="agent-summary sr-only" aria-labelledby="website-summary-title">
    <div class="agent-summary-panel">
      <h2 id="website-summary-title">Website Creation Service Summary</h2>
      <p>Based in Casablanca, Designs of desire builds premium websites and digital systems for creators, models, independent brands, and luxury-leaning businesses that need a clear home, direct selling path, or custom automation flow.</p>
      <dl>
        <dt>Primary service</dt>
        <dd>Custom websites, creator commerce platforms, and bespoke digital systems.</dd>
        <dt>Ideal clients</dt>
        <dd>Creators, models, adult creators and niche platforms, personal brands, digital product sellers, and premium small businesses.</dd>
        <dt>Included deliverables</dt>
        <dd>Mobile-first design, brand-consistent styling, booking or contact paths, commerce or membership features when scoped, and a clearer offer structure.</dd>
        <dt>Pricing logic</dt>
        <dd>Starter: Link & Look: EUR 150-250. Growth: Creator Presence: EUR 400-700. Pro: Monetization Hub: EUR 1,000-1,600. Business: Creator Business: EUR 2,000+ after discovery. Upgrades credit previous payments toward the higher package; examples use common anchor prices of EUR 200, EUR 600, and EUR 1,300.</dd>
        <dt>Typical next step</dt>
        <dd>Send a website inquiry with the desired package, deadline, brand links, budget range, and project details.</dd>
      </dl>
      <p class="last-updated">Last updated: May 31, 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Web Cards -->
  <section class="container web-cards-grid reveal" aria-labelledby="website-packages-title">
    <h2 id="website-packages-title" class="sr-only">Website Creation Packages</h2>
    <p class="web-journey-line">4 tiers mapped to the actual creator journey. Start where you are, then upgrade later with your previous payment credited.</p>
    <div class="web-card">
      <div class="fit-label">Starter</div>
      <h3 style="font-size: 2.2rem;">Link & Look</h3>
      <div class="gold-gradient-text web-price">€150–250</div>
      <p class="web-price-note">One-time, no subscription</p>
      <p class="follower-fit">Best for under 5K followers</p>
      <p class="web-fit">For micro creators with under 5k followers who need more than a Linktree but aren't ready for a full site.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Single-page landing: bio, links, teaser gallery</li>
        <li>Link-in-bio replacement</li>
        <li>Age gate / disclaimer page</li>
        <li>OF / Fansly / Patreon link blocks</li>
        <li>Mobile-first design</li>
        <li>DM / contact CTA</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="payment-plan"><strong>Payment plan</strong>2-Pay — 50% at delivery, 50% two weeks later</p>
      <a href="#website-quote-form" class="btn btn-outline" style="width: 100%;" data-quote-service="Starter: Link & Look">Explore this tier</a>
    </div>

    <div class="web-card premium">
      <span class="recommended-pill">Most needed</span>
      <div class="fit-label">Growth</div>
      <h3 style="font-size: 2.2rem;">Creator Presence</h3>
      <div class="gold-gradient-text web-price">€400–700</div>
      <p class="web-price-note">One-time build</p>
      <p class="follower-fit">Best for 5K–50K followers</p>
      <p class="web-fit">For creators with a niche audience, like foot fetish, feet content, or adult modeling, who need a real home base off social.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Multi-page site: home, about, services, contact</li>
        <li>Tasteful teaser gallery</li>
        <li>Custom booking/request form for DMs or commissions</li>
        <li>Platform link hub for all monetization</li>
        <li>Age verification gate</li>
        <li>Basic SEO for fetish/niche search terms</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="payment-plan"><strong>Payment plan</strong>3-Pay — 40% at delivery, 30% after 2 weeks, 30% after 4 weeks</p>
      <a href="#website-quote-form" class="btn btn-primary" style="width: 100%;" data-quote-service="Growth: Creator Presence">Explore this tier</a>
    </div>

    <div class="web-card elite">
      <div class="fit-label">Pro</div>
      <h3 style="font-size: 2.2rem;">Monetization Hub</h3>
      <div class="gold-gradient-text web-price">€1,000–1,600</div>
      <p class="web-price-note">One-time build</p>
      <p class="follower-fit">Best for 50K–250K followers</p>
      <p class="web-fit">For established creators ready to sell directly — custom content, subscriptions, clip stores, or private access.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Everything in Creator Presence</li>
        <li>Digital product/clip store: Stripe, crypto-friendly</li>
        <li>Subscription or members-only area</li>
        <li>Custom content request system with pricing tiers</li>
        <li>Wishlist integration: Amazon, throne.com</li>
        <li>Tip jar/pay-per-message flow</li>
        <li>DMCA takedown page + watermark guidance</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="payment-plan"><strong>Payment plan</strong>4-Pay Monthly — 25% at delivery, then 25% monthly for 3 months</p>
      <a href="#website-quote-form" class="btn btn-outline" style="width: 100%;" data-quote-service="Pro: Monetization Hub">Explore this tier</a>
    </div>

    <div class="web-card business-tier">
      <div class="business-card-layout">
        <div class="business-card-main">
          <div class="fit-label">Business</div>
          <h3 style="font-size: 2.2rem;">Creator Business</h3>
          <div class="gold-gradient-text web-price">€2,000+</div>
          <p class="web-price-note">Scoped after discovery call</p>
          <p class="follower-fit">Best for 250K+ followers</p>
          <p class="web-fit">For creators running an actual business: team accounts, multiple revenue streams, brand deals, automation, and protection flows that need custom planning.</p>
          <p class="payment-plan"><strong>Payment plan</strong>Discussed individually per project scope</p>
        </div>
        <div class="business-card-details">
          <ul class="business-feature-grid">
            <li>Everything in Monetization Hub</li>
            <li>Multi-persona or multi-brand setup</li>
            <li>Chatbot or intake automation for fan screening</li>
            <li>Collab/affiliate program for other creators</li>
            <li>Advanced analytics dashboard</li>
            <li>Custom DRM/content protection flows</li>
            <li>Full brand identity integration</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="#website-quote-form" class="btn btn-outline" style="width: 100%;" data-quote-service="Business: Creator Business">Explore this tier</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <aside class="upgrade-policy" aria-labelledby="upgrade-policy-title">
      <div class="upgrade-policy-header">
        <div>
          <div class="fit-label">Upgrade credit policy</div>
          <h3 id="upgrade-policy-title">Your previous payment counts toward the next tier.</h3>
          <p>When you move from one package to a higher package, the amount already paid is credited toward the new package. The numbers below are examples only, using common anchor prices inside each range.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="upgrade-rule" aria-label="Upgrade formula">
          <span>Simple rule</span>
          <strong>New package price - amount already paid</strong>
          <small>Final upgrade pricing uses the package price agreed for your project.</small>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="upgrade-table" role="table" aria-label="Package upgrade examples">
        <div class="upgrade-row" role="row">
          <span role="columnheader">Upgrade</span>
          <span role="columnheader">Example calculation</span>
        </div>
        <div class="upgrade-row" role="row">
          <span class="upgrade-example-label" role="cell">Example</span>
          <span class="upgrade-example-title" role="cell">Starter to Growth</span>
          <span class="upgrade-example-math" role="cell">If Growth is scoped at <strong>EUR 600</strong> and Starter paid was <strong>EUR 200</strong>, the upgrade is <strong>EUR 400 remaining</strong>.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="upgrade-row" role="row">
          <span class="upgrade-example-label" role="cell">Example</span>
          <span class="upgrade-example-title" role="cell">Growth to Pro</span>
          <span class="upgrade-example-math" role="cell">If Pro is scoped at <strong>EUR 1,300</strong> and Growth paid was <strong>EUR 600</strong>, the upgrade is <strong>EUR 700 remaining</strong>.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="upgrade-row" role="row">
          <span class="upgrade-example-label" role="cell">Example</span>
          <span class="upgrade-example-title" role="cell">Starter to Pro</span>
          <span class="upgrade-example-math" role="cell">If Pro is scoped at <strong>EUR 1,300</strong> and Starter paid was <strong>EUR 200</strong>, the upgrade is <strong>EUR 1,100 remaining</strong>.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="upgrade-row" role="row">
          <span class="upgrade-example-label" role="cell">Example</span>
          <span class="upgrade-example-title" role="cell">Pro to Business</span>
          <span class="upgrade-example-math" role="cell">Previous payment is credited, then the final Business price is scoped after the discovery call.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </section>

  <!-- ROI Calculator -->
  <section class="calculator-section reveal" id="roi-calculator">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="text-center" style="font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 15px;">What Could a Website Help You Keep?</h2>
      <p class="text-center" style="opacity: 0.8; margin-bottom: 60px;">Start with what you currently keep each month. The calculator estimates your full monthly potential, then shows what the selected website package may help recover.</p>
      
      <div class="calc-container">
        <div class="calc-grid">
          
          <div class="calc-inputs">
            <div class="input-group">
              <label>Current Monthly Income You Keep <span id="income-value">€5,000</span></label>
              <input type="range" id="monthly-income" min="100" max="20000" step="100" value="5000">
            </div>
            <div class="input-group">
              <label>Where Most People Find You</label>
              <select id="platform-select">
                <option value="Instagram" data-kind="social" data-missed="40" data-fee="0">Instagram - no fee, estimated 40% missed potential</option>
                <option value="Twitter / X" data-kind="social" data-missed="40" data-fee="0">Twitter / X - no fee, estimated 40% missed potential</option>
                <option value="OnlyFans" data-kind="fee" data-missed="40" data-fee="20">OnlyFans - 20% fee + estimated 40% missed potential</option>
                <option value="Fansly" data-kind="fee" data-missed="40" data-fee="20">Fansly - 20% fee + estimated 40% missed potential</option>
                <option value="FeetFinder" data-kind="fee" data-missed="40" data-fee="20">FeetFinder - 20% fee + estimated 40% missed potential</option>
                <option value="Fanvue" data-kind="fee" data-missed="40" data-fee="15">Fanvue - 15% fee + estimated 40% missed potential</option>
                <option value="Patreon" data-kind="fee" data-missed="40" data-fee="10">Patreon - 10% fee + estimated 40% missed potential</option>
              </select>
            </div>
            <div class="input-group">
              <label>Website Package</label>
              <select id="website-package">
                <option value="200" data-name="Starter: Link & Look" data-potential="8" selected>Starter: Link & Look (€150–€250)</option>
                <option value="600" data-name="Growth: Creator Presence" data-potential="15">Growth: Creator Presence (€400–€700)</option>
                <option value="1300" data-name="Pro: Monetization Hub" data-potential="25">Pro: Monetization Hub (€1,000–€1,600)</option>
                <option value="2000" data-name="Business: Creator Business" data-potential="40">Business: Creator Business (€2,000+)</option>
              </select>
            </div>
            <div class="input-group">
              <label>Timeframe <span id="years-value">1 Year</span></label>
              <input type="range" id="years" min="1" max="5" step="1" value="1">
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="calc-outputs calc-story-output">
            <article class="calc-result-card" aria-labelledby="calc-result-title">
              <span class="calc-eyebrow" id="calc-result-title">Recovered potential / selected timeframe</span>
              <strong class="calc-hero-number" id="out-yearly-saved">€8,000</strong>
              <p id="out-conclusion">Over 1 year, that is roughly €8,000 in recovered potential for a one-time €200 investment.</p>
            </article>

            <p class="calc-story-line" id="calc-explainer-text">Right now, <span id="out-platform-name">Instagram</span> may be costing you around <strong id="out-yearly">€667/month</strong> in recoverable potential. Estimated payback: <strong id="out-breakeven">1 Month</strong>.</p>

            <div class="calc-cost-strip">
              <div>
                <span>Package cost</span>
                <small><span id="out-package-name">Starter: Link & Look</span> · one-time website investment</small>
              </div>
              <strong id="out-website">€200</strong>
            </div>

            <details class="calc-details">
              <summary>See how we calculated this</summary>
              <div class="calc-detail-panel">
                <p class="calc-detail-note"><strong id="calc-explainer-title">Instagram estimate</strong><span id="out-yearly-help">Starter: Link & Look uses an 8% recovery estimate from the full potential.</span></p>
                <div class="calc-detail-row">
                  <span><strong>Estimated missed potential before the website</strong><small id="out-monthly-help">Mostly missed buying-path value. No platform fee is counted for Instagram.</small></span>
                  <span class="calc-detail-value" id="out-monthly">€3,333</span>
                </div>
                <div class="calc-detail-row">
                  <span><strong>Estimated monthly total after the website</strong><small>Current income + estimated website recovery.</small></span>
                  <span class="calc-detail-value" id="out-after-monthly">€5,667</span>
                </div>
                <div class="calc-detail-row">
                  <span><strong id="out-savings-label">Net recovered value after cost</strong><small>Recovered value across your selected timeframe, minus the one-time website cost.</small></span>
                  <span class="calc-detail-value" id="out-savings">€7,800</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </details>
          </div>

        </div>
        <p class="text-center" style="margin-top: 15px; opacity: 0.7; font-size: 0.9rem;">Estimates are planning tools, not guaranteed income. Actual results depend on audience quality, offer, traffic, pricing, and consistency.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Timeline -->
  <section class="uniform-stripe timeline-section reveal">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>The Creation Process</h2>
      <div class="timeline">
        <div class="timeline-step">
          <div class="step-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"></path><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"></polyline><line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"></line><line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"></line><polyline points="10 9 9 9 8 9"></polyline></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="step-title">1. Discovery Brief</div>
          <div class="step-desc">Vision & Scope</div>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-step">
          <div class="step-icon">
