﻿# Website Creation

Last updated: 2026-06-11

## Summary

Designs of desire builds premium websites and digital systems for creators, models, independent brands, and luxury-leaning businesses.

## Packages

- Starter: Link & Look: EUR 150-250
- Growth: Creator Presence: EUR 400-700
- Pro: Monetization Hub: EUR 1,000-1,600
- Business: Creator Business: EUR 2,000+ after discovery
